# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# REAL credentials. Logins\*.txt are plain-text account files (Name|Email|
# Password). The app creates the folder and a starter file on first run.
# NEVER commit this folder. See docs/sample-login-format.txt for the format.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Logins/

# Belt and braces: wherever they turn up, these are never publishable.
**/Logins/
**/Backups/
**/idle-history.txt
**/quota-log.txt
*.bak
*.tmp

# Test sandbox + generated results (recreated by every run)
tests/Logins/
**/*-results.txt
**/*-progress.txt

# The documented sample IS meant to ship - it contains only fake data.
!docs/sample-login-format.txt
